usage: __main__.py [-h] {list,config,run,legacy} ...

Organized GraspGen/cuRobo LIBERO pipeline, frozen v10 policy

positional arguments:
  {list,config,run,legacy}
    list                List the frozen 130 task keys
    config              Print the effective launch config; no model or
                        environment
    run                 Run a task using the configured simulation interpreter
    legacy              Original explicit single-task doctor/run interface

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
